        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Peverett, Jimi Hendrix\n- Roles: singer, musician, guitarist, songwriter, lead vocalist, rhythm guitarist\n- Bands: Foghat, Savoy Brown\n\nFacts:\n- Jimi Hendrix was born Johnny Allen Hendrix on November 27, 1942, and he was an American rock guitarist, singer, and songwriter.\n- Dave Peverett was born on April 16, 1943, and he was an English singer and musician also known as Lonesome Dave.\n- Jimi Hendrix died on September 18, 1970.\n- Dave Peverett founded the rock band Foghat after his tenure in Savoy Brown.\n- Dave Peverett was the original lead vocalist and rhythm guitarist of Foghat.\n- Dave Peverett died on February 7, 2000.",
